# Coinglass v4 API key. Get one at https://www.coinglass.com/pricing
# Without a key, Coinglass-backed panels (liquidations, OI, long/short,
# funding, max-pain) will simply render as N/A — Binance OHLCV still works.
COINGLASS_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides
# COINGLASS_BASE_URL=https://open-api-v4.coinglass.com
# BINANCE_BASE_URL=https://api.binance.com
# HTTP_TIMEOUT=10
